---
import DecoreHorizon from '../assets/DecoreHorizon.svg';
import SlideContainer from './SlideContainer.astro';
---

<article class="intro-slide">
    <SlideContainer class="intro-slide__container">
        <div class="intro-slide__top-decoration">
            <DecoreHorizon class="horizon-decoration _top-shift" />
        </div>
        <h1 class="intro-slide__title slide-title">
            <span class="slide-title__fragment">The Price</span>
            <span class="slide-title__fragment slide-title__fragment_preposition">of</span>
            <span class="slide-title__fragment">The War</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="intro-slide__text slide-text">
            Once upon a time, a warrior named Cossack Mamai clashed with the
            enormous bear. Probably, it was the biggest bear that has ever existed.
            Overwhelmed by its colossal stature, Mamai begs princess Europa, the
            daughter of Agenor, and her steadfast companion Eagle, to lend their aid
            in resisting the wrath of nature. In exchange for their valiant efforts,
            he vowed to deliver the hide of the beast. Europa and Eagle consented to
            this perilous endeavor. But they paid too dearly for this battle: none
            of the peaceful initiatives cost as much as this struggle against the
            ferocious ursine adversary.
        </p>
        <div class="intro-slide__bottom-decoration">
            <DecoreHorizon class="horizon-decoration _top-shift" />
        </div>
    </SlideContainer>
</article>

<style>
    .intro-slide {
        --top-padding: 55rem;

        .intro-slide__container {
            position: relative;
        }

        .intro-slide__top-decoration,
        .intro-slide__bottom-decoration {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            .horizon-decoration {
                width: clamp(230rem, 193.333rem + 11.458vw, 340rem);
                --shift: 30rem;

                &._top-shift {
                    transform: translateY(var(--shift));
                    margin: 0 0 clamp(50rem, 30rem + 6.25vw, 110rem) 0;
                }

                &._bottom-shift {
                    transform: translateY(calc(var(--shift) * -1));
                    margin: clamp(50rem, 30rem + 6.25vw, 110rem) 0 0 0;
                }
            }

            &:before,
            &:after {
                display: block;
                width: clamp(120rem, 70rem + 7.813vw, 170rem);
                position: absolute;
            }
        }

        .intro-slide__top-decoration {
            @media screen and (min-width: 640px) {
                &:before,
                &:after {
                    content: url("../assets/Decore.svg");
                }
            }

            &:before {
                left: var(--top-padding);
                top: var(--top-padding);
                transform: scaleX(-1) scaleY(-1);
            }

            &:after {
                right: var(--top-padding);
                top: var(--top-padding);
                transform: scaleY(-1);
            }
        }

        .intro-slide__bottom-decoration {
            @media screen and (min-width: 900px) {
                &:before,
                &:after {
                    content: url("../assets/Decore.svg");
                }
            }

            &:before {
                left: var(--top-padding);
                transform: scaleX(-1);
                bottom: var(--top-padding);
            }

            &:after {
                right: var(--top-padding);
                bottom: var(--top-padding);
            }
        }

        .intro-slide__title {
            margin: 0 0 22rem;
        }

        .intro-slide__text {
            max-width: 600rem;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
    }

    .slide-title {
        font-family: var(--font-beware);
        font-size: clamp(54rem, 35.333rem + 5.833vw, 110rem);
        color: var(--accent);
        text-align: center;

        .slide-title__fragment {
            display: block;
        }

        .slide-title__fragment_preposition {
            font-size: 0.3em;
            margin: -0.7em 0 -1.1em 0;
        }
    }

    .slide-text {
        font-family: var(--font-segoe-script);
        font-size: clamp(16rem, 14.667rem + 0.417vw, 20rem);
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: justify;
        text-align-last: center;
    }
</style>
